      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{68098a4626271974ef4d2775|full_name} I made a canny for the user invite one based on my testing/observations. It does seem to resolve itself in a few minutes in most cases, though in one case I was unable to request an invite from a user for over 10 minutes was only able to request after I left the instance we were both originally in.\n\nIt also seemed to happen more consistently on the Beta. On live I'd sometimes be able to request on the other user right away. \n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/invite-invite-request-behavior-for-user-who-was-just-in-the-same-instance-is-bro",
